after:
Run this example in a fresh database:
```sql
CREATE TABLE demo_readings (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
  value INTEGER
);
INSERT INTO demo_readings VALUES (1, '12'), (2, 'twelve');
SELECT id, value, typeof(value) AS kind
FROM demo_readings
ORDER BY id;
```
Row 1 stores integer `12`. Row 2 stores the text `twelve`.
